Design a 3-bit binary counter that increments its value on each rising edge of the clock signal. Upon receiving a reset signal, the counter will return to zero. The counter cycles through the values from 0 to 7 and wraps around to 0 after reaching 7, providing a simple state progression through its defined range.
module top_module(
  input clk,
  input reset,
  output reg [2:0] count
);

